// Cloudflare: the built app (dist) as a Worker's static assets (docs/decisions.md, 2026-11-02). No server code yet: the
// Timely and scan-AI servers wait for sign-in on the server, as anyone with the link could reach them otherwise.
// Deploy: npm run deploy (Wrangler, with its usage statistics turned off).
{
  "name": "gobi-erp",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "assets": { "directory": "./dist" }
}
